shellDispatch(operation, argument Array) -> typed result or signal
    Validate operation arguments and execute the host filesystem operation.
    Resolve paths relative to a supplied base, including home abbreviations using the effective session home environment.
    Require directory existence before accepting navigation.
    Return sorted directory names as Array elements without splitting filenames.
    Read text or write/append text, checking open, write and close failures.
    Create directories including missing parents.
    Recursively match regular filenames and return relative paths in traversal order.
    Find lines containing a literal substring.
    Validate environment names and string-or-unset values without reading credentials.
    File failures signal operation, path and the underlying error.
